CodeSystem: TDContactMethodCS
Id: td-contact-method
Title: "TD Contact Method Code System"
Description: "Codes for the methods by which a patient prefers to be contacted by their care team."

* #phone    "Phone"    "Contact via telephone call"
* #sms      "SMS"      "Contact via SMS text message"
* #email    "Email"    "Contact via email"
* #video    "Video"    "Contact via video call (e.g. MyChart, Zoom Health)"
* #in-person "In Person" "Patient prefers an in-person visit or clinic call"
